    "title":  "输出是什么？",
    "desc":  "```javascript\nfunction getAge() {\n  \u0027use strict\u0027\n  age = 21\n  console.log(age)\n}\n\ngetAge()\n```",
    "options":  "{\"options\":[\"21\",\"undefined\",\"ReferenceError\",\"TypeError\"],\"isMulti\":false,\"answer\":[2]}",
